<section class="service-overview"><div class="service-kicker">Speed with coordination</div><h1>Air freight that fits your deadline</h1><p>When time matters, air freight connects your cargo with major markets quickly. <%= business.name %> coordinates flight schedules, cargo preparation, airport handling, paperwork, and onward delivery.</p><p>We review your deadline, cargo size, available routes, restrictions, and budget to recommend a suitable priority, standard, or consolidated service.</p></section>
<section class="service-features"><h2 class="service-section-title">Air freight solutions</h2><div class="row g-4">
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-plane-up"></i><h3>Priority air freight</h3><p>Priority routing for cargo that needs the next suitable flight connection.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i><h3>Scheduled air freight</h3><p>Scheduled air transport for shipments that need reliable transit with more flexible deadlines.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-packing"></i><h3>Cargo preparation</h3><p>Help preparing cargo information, packaging, labels, and shipment documents.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-route"></i><h3>Door coordination</h3><p>Coordinated collection, airport transfers, customs support, and final delivery.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="service-process"><h2 class="service-section-title">How air freight works</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">01</div><h3>Confirm</h3><p>We check the cargo, deadline, and applicable restrictions.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">02</div><h3>Schedule</h3><p>We select a route and service suited to your shipment.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">03</div><h3>Coordinate</h3><p>We coordinate handoffs and monitor key transport stages.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">04</div><h3>Complete</h3><p>We arrange the arrival handoff and onward delivery.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-faqs"><h2 class="service-section-title">Questions about air freight</h2><div class="accordion" id="airFaq"><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#airOne">What details are needed to plan air freight?</button></h3><div id="airOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#airFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Send the cargo type, number of packages, dimensions, weight, origin, destination, ready date, delivery deadline, and any special handling requirements.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#airTwo">Can all goods travel by air?</button></h3><div id="airTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#airFaq"><div class="accordion-body">No. Some goods are restricted by airlines or authorities. Describe the contents accurately so we can review the relevant handling and paperwork requirements.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#airThree">Can you coordinate collection and delivery?</button></h3><div id="airThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#airFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Yes, where the service is available. We can arrange the ground transport needed before and after the airport journey.</div></div></div></div></section>
<div class="service-cta"><div><h2>Let’s review your deadline</h2><p>Share your deadline and we’ll help you explore suitable flight options.</p></div><a href="/quote?service=air_freight" class="btn-default">Request a Quote</a></div></div></div></div></main><%- include('../partials/site-footer') %><script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script><script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script><script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script><script src="/js/service-navigation.js"></script></body></html>
